<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Darko Herceg — Developer & SaaS Builder</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🚀</text></svg>">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="container">
        <div class="logo">Darko Herceg</div>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
                <li><a href="/menuboost">MenuBoost</a></li>
                <li><a href="/boostsuite">BoostSuite</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙</button>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home" class="hero container">
            <h1>Building SaaS that solves real problems</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">
                Hi, I'm Darko — a developer and indie maker from Slovenia.
                I create AI‑powered tools for restaurants, marketers, and businesses.
                Simple, effective, and built to scale.
            </p>
            <a href="#projects" class="cta-button">See my work</a>
        </section>

        <section id="projects" class="section container">
            <h2 class="section-title">My Projects</h2>
            <div class="projects-grid">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h3>MenuBoost</h3>
                    <p>AI‑powered multilingual menu descriptions for restaurants. Generate poetic, compelling food descriptions in 6 languages in seconds.</p>
                    <div class="project-tags">
                        <span class="tag">AI</span>
                        <span class="tag">Restaurants</span>
                        <span class="tag">Multilingual</span>
                        <span class="tag">SaaS</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/menuboost" class="cta-button">Learn more</a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h3>BoostSuite</h3>
                    <p>4‑in‑1 AI marketing toolkit: SEO Audit, GEO Check, Ad Copy Generator, and Listing Optimizer. Built for agencies and freelancers.</p>
                    <div class="project-tags">
                        <span class="tag">AI</span>
                        <span class="tag">Marketing</span>
                        <span class="tag">SEO</span>
                        <span class="tag">Agency</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/boostsuite" class="cta-button">Learn more</a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h3>SEO Booster AI</h3>
                    <p>Automated SEO analysis and recommendations for small businesses. Get actionable insights without the complexity.</p>
                    <div class="project-tags">
                        <span class="tag">SEO</span>
                        <span class="tag">Automation</span>
                        <span class="tag">Small Business</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="https://seoboosterai.netlify.app" class="cta-button" target="_blank">Visit site</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="contact container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Get in touch</h2>
            <p>
                Whether you're interested in collaboration, have feedback on my tools, or just want to chat about SaaS — I'd love to hear from you.
            </p>
            <div class="contact-links">
                <a href="mailto:darko@hd-webdesign.si" class="contact-link">
                    ✉️ darko@hd-webdesign.si
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/herceg23" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
                    🔗 GitHub
                </a>
                <a href="https://twitter.com/herceg23" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
                    🐦 Twitter
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/darko-herceg-9a1b4b1b0/" class="contact-link" target="_blank">
                    💼 LinkedIn
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="container">
        <p>© 2026 Darko Herceg. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Slovenia · Built with 💻 and ☕️</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>